{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1000_null", "source_sha256": "96070f6efb40b9e4892e623c566db01713bc9fd65f7010589e59192994c77e50", "ja": "LOVERS HEARTのツアーが始まる少し前……", "zh": "LOVERS HEART的巡演开始前不久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dfadc3065f0b0084a776fe1c26b7334cfd2f3e9fd77916b9d8d8589dd3395611", "ja": "（劇場の定期公演で、美奈子が新曲を歌う事になった。\n……が、肝心の美奈子の姿を、今日はまだ見てないな）", "zh": "（美奈子要在剧场的定期公演上演唱新歌。……不过，今天到现在还没见到美奈子本人呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "1febd169c3c1e8bbabe1183669004d1e8fdefb0a110b780202eef624bf493e30", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。\n美奈子たち、なんだか遅くないか？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n美奈子她们是不是有点晚了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "0f1826571bea2bf03c87ef95a3bcb80366ab941020db1ec43fc3d3838603bb81", "ja": "佐竹さん、いつもは早く来ているのに……\n何かあったのでしょうか。", "zh": "佐竹小姐平时明明总是很早就到……  \n难道发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1004_p", "source_sha256": "809cead5a964b54bb46751f0099eaeca968c0c9ed99030baea38c1f67c7e51c8", "ja": "そうだな、俺も気になっていたところなんだ。\nちょっと様子を見に……ん？", "zh": "是啊，我也正觉得奇怪呢。去看看她的情况……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1005_se", "source_sha256": "87e635fd0d100f0fbbd5243bd40b01894e9976e8c04c32bfc008a2e2a25d0c8d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "bfe07eb72c513a9942e243225a87a00556d9615099746a02e6dbb51d63f79a37", "ja": "すみません、遅れちゃいました！", "zh": "不好意思，我来晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "638c663cecbf5ab028134021d329f8a242374697932a49f6ecb292f699ebe7e3", "ja": "お、ようやく主役の登場だな！\nみんな遅かったけど、何してたんだ？", "zh": "哦，主角终于登场了啊！你们都来晚了，在忙什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "ffd83ba8c403e59c6c2d02bd66b692a39a276f1c8da3964c164f2be8418dc5c7", "ja": "はい。わたしたち、探しものをしていて……。", "zh": "是的。我们刚才在找东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1009_p", "source_sha256": "128c5070f3012f25fd9847c9c9d175ffe6dfbdc58633522fdb86ba328e39f897", "ja": "探しもの？", "zh": "要找东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "da6d9017613177d0a33c5d843b16307d545e11e30c434a350b8b729be66daaa2", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！　たまきのハンカチが、\nどっかいっちゃったんだぞ～！", "zh": "老大——！环的手帕不见了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a9f8997e70adb72c37601190d9649ae2d1345a3405a2f2da5d9a136e1b5428d", "ja": "みなことせりかが探すの手伝ってくれたんだけど、\n見つからなくて……。", "zh": "美奈子和星梨花帮我一起找了，\n但是没有找到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7e43b5c0b2d07fe7f0b4a9f4feda45ff0faa4898fc82219286d517cc8abb0fbd", "ja": "そうだったのか。わかった、青羽さんにも\n聞いておくよ。落とし物で届いているかもしれないし。", "zh": "原来是这样。我知道了，我也会去问问青羽小姐。说不定有人把它作为失物交上来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95f47e44e40c0513efbd9d5ae8ae2a8dcb4a629e4e095052e347d1aa706cdd92", "ja": "美奈子、星梨花も、ありがとうな。\nレッスンが終わったら、俺も探してみるよ。", "zh": "美奈子、星梨花，也谢谢你们。\n等练习结束后，我也会找找看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "d7b357e50da89b589e29db9c84401e48f52c25bcfa4cced0fff37eff87330b29", "ja": "いいえ！　私がやりたくてやっただけですから。\nそれに、結局見つかってないし……。", "zh": "不！只是我自己想做才做的。\n而且最后还是没找到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "ae95b763733328471a2df075751ff3aa5cf2a9a3c0c318aefbed240efed2e4bf", "ja": "終わったらまた探そうね、環ちゃん！", "zh": "结束后我们再一起找吧，小环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "9c9390573000b7b0330ec8477f8964d3cceacca05c97239a2c3da970cb996005", "ja": "でしたら、私も手伝いましょう。\nみんなで探せば、きっと見つかるはず。……人海戦術。", "zh": "这样的话，我也来帮忙吧。\n大家一起找的话，一定能找到的。……人海战术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "b44eeb0950c2a4e001e9ea8fa21b7678984f355397727ce1c7a908f1c0b01ec1", "ja": "わあ、頼もしいです！\nみんなで探せば、きっと出てきますよね！", "zh": "哇，真是可靠！\n大家一起找的话，一定能找到的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "d021536570680e65be248f51945d8d909beb5b4b82e4f16a46b3eb0342db3beb", "ja": "もちろん、あたしも手伝うぜ。\nよし、急いでレッスンを片付けないとな！", "zh": "当然，我也会帮忙。好，得赶紧把训练搞定才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ab56eb9327f45c3572ab45be86327779f0e46ba10364482f40cbbb64c13c9943", "ja": "そうだな。定期公演まで、あまり時間もないし。\n特に美奈子は、次の公演で新曲お披露目もあるしな。", "zh": "是啊，距离定期公演已经没多少时间了。\n尤其是美奈子，下次公演还要首次演唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "5b170b5dbe215f003072974694539bd25d7be64029361317a021ed29562678f1", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃみんな、\n遅くなっちゃったけど、レッスン始めようか！", "zh": "明白了！那么大家，虽然有点晚了，我们开始上课吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "34ab55463b98012771d9e4771a1dde632544153a3b79acf49030414dd6cf0868", "ja": "あ、ドリンク用意してるから、必要だったら言ってね！\nそれから、糖分補給用のアメもここに……。", "zh": "啊，我准备了饮料，需要的话就告诉我哦！\n还有补充糖分的糖果也在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e5d86a3cd99618c98cab10e3abe36c696c91a0f861a468219b2e876dfa34596c", "ja": "美奈子。みんなのお世話もいいけど、\n新曲公演くらい、自分の事に集中していいんだぞ？", "zh": "美奈子。照顾大家是很好，不过新曲公演，你也可以专心顾好自己啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "e0071c44789d5a4dbb83ac9806cd2dc71a5107a564e84128373857361d005f01", "ja": "あっ、そうでした……えへへ。\nわかりました、レッスンに集中します！", "zh": "啊，对哦……嘿嘿。\n我知道了，我会专心练习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "0352e489404f63479de99d43017b08541eac87e456044db0bc4bc8612b93631a", "ja": "美奈子はホント、世話焼きだな。\nもうすこしワガママになってもいいのに。", "zh": "美奈子真是爱操心啊。\n明明可以再任性一点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "36827d8f3950494f3682384e4de599a54e44bb121b0e81b9b9d9a0580aa6b021", "ja": "ワガママかぁ……。", "zh": "任性啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f2c2ee91e7186839a9789445091718f6c85cf5d31c16deaa449fb4ff31a7d443", "ja": "（その後、環のハンカチは無事見つかった。\n昼寝をしていたこぶんの下敷きになっていたらしい）", "zh": "（之后，环的手帕顺利找到了。好像是被午睡的小伙伴压在了下面。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1028_p", "source_sha256": "cf5aff8957024ecbee6625025e17a8077ca210950de04b2968ba89b0e0bb0930", "ja": "（それにしても美奈子の面倒見の良さは筋金入りだな。\n助かってはいるものの、こう忙しいと少し心配だ……）", "zh": "（话说回来，美奈子照顾人的本事还真是货真价实啊。\n虽然确实帮了大忙，可这么忙碌，还是让人有点担心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1029_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "bbf5ee9c523c4621f7db4462798a815c3259c40de972837869d8e8a2d108361b", "ja": "……よし、日誌終わり！\nあとは職員室に持っていけばOK、と。", "zh": "……好，日志写完了！\n接下来只要送到教职员室就搞定啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "c09edd70e30aeed28dd88a451b5621ba389c3e117af3dfcc885bd71ea61f71d7", "ja": "今日は久しぶりにレッスンがないから、\n帰ってお店の手伝いしないとな～。", "zh": "今天难得没有练习，\n得回去帮忙店里的事了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1032_classmatea", "source_sha256": "58232dc2d70019cf6d28ac6a44d780e4a50d23e9879123ddf4c93bf57b14e9e3", "ja": "あ、美奈子！　もう帰っちゃうの？", "zh": "啊，美奈子！这就要回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "8401d15203285678d07c5e47f142d456b348a2c6333028122c36f4f11ac2e565", "ja": "うん、日直の仕事も終わったし……\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "嗯，值日生的工作也做完了……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1034_classmatea", "source_sha256": "b126a2080d44530392998a199f395b139e39beae38e9dd4d4fd1b4e7c77eaaf1", "ja": "今、進路希望を書いてたんだけど。美奈子はなんて\n書いたのか、参考にさせてもらおうかと思って。", "zh": "我刚才正在写升学志愿来着。想着看看美奈子写了什么，拿来参考一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "18415de2059673643bfdf69eaeace97716c829a0785faca36a24290ffb326915", "ja": "進路希望……そっか、今週提出だったよね。\nでも私も、まだ何も書けてないんだ。", "zh": "志愿升学方向……这样啊，这周就要提交了吧。\n不过我也还什么都没写呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1036_classmateb", "source_sha256": "2e8def01d1ebf67d459cb94b0616f7c35e33b8af5db6edae087f0fcb1419bba8", "ja": "え、美奈子も進路希望出すの？\nアイドル続けるんじゃなくて？", "zh": "诶，美奈子也要提交未来志愿吗？\n不继续当偶像了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "54dd97d8b1d8d1aa2e3b384ca6437a4175f1e764f63848a80f31c3b5c4b8f530", "ja": "えっ！？　もちろん、アイドルを辞めるつもりは\nないけど……でも、提出物だし。", "zh": "诶！？我当然没打算放弃偶像……不过，这也是要提交的材料嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1038_classmatea", "source_sha256": "d263f1cf81c22b6070abf4373ca4b240f92476bd291844ddc998d957876eec84", "ja": "あー、そうだった！　いいなぁ、美奈子は。\n進路で悩む必要ないもんね？", "zh": "啊，对了！美奈子真好啊。\n不用为未来的道路烦恼呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "b48e36f42b7b0d0734aa5deda1e4ffdf798aa4c046d74b8ef54496795a044d72", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　でも、悩むことが\nないってわけじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？不过，也不是完全没有烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1040_classmatea", "source_sha256": "580a960bd94c1c2a18dcbb30e5372b00f8b6fa5f8593551f8067ab5f3508ba4b", "ja": "そっか……やっぱアイドルも、卒業とかあるもんね。\nそういう意味では学校と同じかぁ。", "zh": "原来如此……偶像也会有毕业之类的事呢。\n这样说来，和学校一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1041_classmateb", "source_sha256": "8c78e011c7f7be46e7c37afc701a04117e87d5ef7c5c32523e8f6bcdf67746f3", "ja": "でもアイドル辞めても、だいたいタレントとか、\n女優になったりとかするでしょ？", "zh": "不过，就算不当偶像了，大多也会去做艺能工作，或者当演员之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1042_classmateb", "source_sha256": "0294750ea99969285c9a4a2a69e080cad0a8010edd93353ab4cd9f2adf91335a", "ja": "美奈子もそうしたらいいじゃん！", "zh": "美奈子也那样做不就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1043_019min", "source_sha256": "addc86ee2953019894868a0503f91e92363df8fed05ae5186cd8f3ccd3a12f06", "ja": "う、うん……そうだね。\n……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……也是呢。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "7763465199cf52af41d16ab9a649d3e4ff32301c0c19093bdb2522fe68366942", "ja": "あっ……ごめん。\n私、お店の手伝いしなくちゃだから。帰るね！", "zh": "啊……抱歉。\n我得帮忙看店，所以先回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "14b5368d153781fb9eef62229123813ffc5c7f18e2e3e55b80e6db77403890fa", "ja": "ふぅ……思わず飛び出してきちゃった。\nふたりとも、変に思っただろうなぁ……。", "zh": "呼……一不小心就跑出来了。\n他们两个肯定觉得很奇怪吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "c7af35905d04bafee21fcb21bb1dc964cd27d8a518c723754a6d47396bb25e5f", "ja": "でも、なんて答えればいいのかわからなかったし……\nん？", "zh": "可是，我也不知道该怎么回答才好……\n嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1048_grandmother", "source_sha256": "e01d4e92267d6330f1ba446048badfb0fba31f67c665a24d8d9691d72537e35c", "ja": "どっこいしょ……はぁ。", "zh": "哎哟……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "fcf4a5caca4b366687d3d7fcff7899dd5d5dd627694930162db5aea08e7f1e95", "ja": "大変！　あのおばあさん、すごい荷物……！", "zh": "不好！那位老奶奶拿了好多行李……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1050_019min", "source_sha256": "c443c559558f8f545e065aeabdb68b24846800f223deaa08aa155596d0ec4922", "ja": "あのっ、大丈夫ですか？\nよかったら私、お手伝いします！", "zh": "那个，请问您还好吗？\n可以的话，就让我来帮您吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1051_grandmother", "source_sha256": "9a0582f85a6d8770226f1731be85fbd26c57e60918a2cba5749f78501d6eb8c0", "ja": "あら……ありがとうねぇ。\nでも大丈夫よ。ほら、あそこが私の家。すぐそこなの。", "zh": "哎呀……谢谢你呀。\n不过没关系的。你看，那边就是我家。就在跟前呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1052_019min", "source_sha256": "a3a56f6b44f10eec47ce545344c4fa9d9c3a515b4378c829cb7aff89d259b08b", "ja": "あ、そうだったんですね……！\nそれじゃ、えっと……お気をつけて！", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……！\n那么，那个……您路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1053_grandmother", "source_sha256": "cd3e7a681438f0be7caf6c149d319611fbb11d9c70cec32a0d3a5ea80fc487ab", "ja": "ええ、ありがとう。お嬢さんも気を付けてね。\nそれじゃ。", "zh": "好的，谢谢。小姐也请多加小心。\n那么，再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1054_019min", "source_sha256": "5c1b6b054d1d88b0cae1d0e9edffd406e8bd1d03c84330464964cb5a660a8b11", "ja": "……あのおばあさんの家、本当に近くだったんだ。\n余計なお世話しちゃったかな……。", "zh": "……那位老奶奶的家，原来真的就在附近啊。\n我是不是多管闲事了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_106_1055_019min", "source_sha256": "928c86aafd8c51b43da49c7f786b0d60879612250cfd7515729c99af4fdb7c7c", "ja": "私って……\nもしかして、お節介なのかな……。", "zh": "我这个人……\n该不会是个爱多管闲事的人吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
